    Install: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts (LocalScript)
    Or: StarterGui (LocalScript with ResetOnSpawn = false)

    ⚠️ CLIENT SECURITY REALITY:
    • loadstring() is BLOCKED in standard LocalScripts.
    • HttpService is SERVER-ONLY; LocalScripts cannot make HTTP requests.
